The legislative texts in this repository (constitution/ and public-service-act-2016/) come from RONLAW
(https://ronlaw.gov.nr), Department of Justice and Border Control, Government of the Republic of Nauru.
They are not protected by copyright: Copyright Act 2019 (Nauru), section 15(4) ("The Republic has no copyright over
nor there exists any copyright in ... (b) any Act as defined in the Interpretation Act 2011") and section 19(b)
("any official text of a legislative, administrative or legal nature").

Attribution: Laws of the Republic of Nauru, consolidated reprints, RONLAW, Department of Justice and Border Control.

Everything else (the tools, the data files, the arrangement and the commit messages) is Lexifina's and is released
under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
